        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Numerical Weather Prediction - GFS vs ECMWF, Ensembles, Chaos",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCONSERVATION OF MOMENTUM (3 components):\n  du/dt = fv - (1/ρ)(∂p/∂x) + F_x  [zonal; x-direction]\n  dv/dt = -fu - (1/ρ)(∂p/∂y) + F_y  [meridional; y-direction]\n  dw/dt = -g - (1/ρ)(∂p/∂z) + F_z  [vertical; often hydrostatic approx]"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-NUMERICAL-WEATHER-PREDICTION.md#008",
      "path": [
        "07-NUMERICAL-WEATHER-PREDICTION.md"
