      "text": "**Hydrostatic approximation** — vertical momentum equation simplified to dw/dt ≈ 0, giving ∂p/∂z = -ρg. Valid for large-scale (horizontal >> vertical scale). Fails in convection → convection must be parameterized (global models) or explicitly resolved (convection-allowing models, ≤ 4 km grid)."
    },
