      "text": "```\nGLOBAL MODELS:\n  Resolution ~12–25 km horizontal; 50–137 vertical levels\n  Domain: entire globe (spherical harmonics or reduced Gaussian grid)\n  Time step: ~1–7 minutes (governed by CFL stability criterion)"
    },
